+---
+id: task-005-cancel-bookings-with-refund
+type: task
+title: "Cancel bookings with refund"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Cancel bookings with refund
+
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking at the instant `at` and returns `{ bookingId, refund }`, the
+amount given back to the customer in euro cents.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- `at` is an ISO-8601 UTC time on the hour; otherwise it throws.
+- Refund policy (from task-001): full refund (the booking `total`) when `at` is at least 24 hours before
+  the booking start; no refund (0) when less than 24 hours before start, or after it.
+- A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment: the item can be booked again for that period and
+  shows in `availability`.
+- A booking can only be cancelled once; an unknown booking id or a second cancel throws.
+- Booking ids are never reused after a cancellation.
